# Shellforge code owners.
#
# Every pull request touching a matched path needs an approving review from the
# listed owner before it can merge. The `main` branch ruleset enforces this; see
# .github/rulesets/main.json and ./scripts/sync-ruleset.sh.
#
# Syntax note: the LAST matching pattern wins, so the catch-all goes first and
# the more specific rules follow it.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
